  "goodToKnow": "Die Peripherie is the periphery or outskirts: an der Peripherie der Stadt (also am Stadtrand), and in computing, peripheral devices (Peripheriegeräte: Drucker, Maus, Tastatur). Politically, structurally weak rural regions are sometimes called die Peripherie as opposed to the booming cities. Peripher means peripheral: eine periphere Rolle. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Peripherien."
